dfaf Kutat\u00e1si m\u00f3d</h3>\n<div id=\"modes\">\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"quick\" checked> Gyors kutat\u00e1s</label>\n<p>Egy l\u00e9pcs\u0151s elemz\u00e9s, gyors eredm\u00e9nyek</p>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"deep\"> M\u00e9ly kutat\u00e1s</label>\n<p>T\u00f6bbl\u00e9pcs\u0151s r\u00e9szletes elemz\u00e9s</p>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"autonomous\"> Auton\u00f3m m\u00f3d</label>\n<p>50 iter\u00e1ci\u00f3s \u00f6n\u00e1ll\u00f3 kutat\u00e1s</p>\n</div>\n<label for=\"time-limit\">\u23f1\ufe0f Id\u0151limit (perc)</label>\n<input type=\"number\" id=\"time-limit\" min=\"1\" placeholder=\"10\">\n<label for=\"max-sources\">\ud83d\udcda Maximum forr\u00e1sok sz\u00e1ma</label>\n<input type=\"number\" id=\"max-sources\" min=\"1\" placeholder=\"20\">\n<button id=\"start-research\">Kutat\u00e1s ind\u00edt\u00e1sa</button>\n</section>\n<section id=\"results\">\n<h2>Kutat\u00e1sok</h2>\n<div id=\"research-results\"></div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"reports\">\n<h2>Jelent\u00e9sek</h2>\n<div id=\"reports-list\"></div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"settings\">\n<h2>\u2699\ufe0f Be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok</h2>\n<label for=\"default-mode\">\ud83c\udfaf Alap\u00e9rtelmezett kutat\u00e1si m\u00f3d</label>\n<select id=\"default-mode\">\n<option value=\"quick\">Gyors</option>\n<option value=\"deep\">M\u00e9ly</option>\n<option value=\"autonomous\">Auton\u00f3m</option>\n</select>\n<label for=\"default-time-limit\">\u23f1\ufe0f Alap\u00e9rtelmezett id\u0151limit (perc)</label>\n<input type=\"number\" id=\"default-time-limit\" min=\"1\" placeholder=\"10\">\n<label for=\"default-max-sources\">\ud83d\udcda Alap\u00e9rtelmezett max forr\u00e1sok</label>\n<input type=\"number\" id=\"default-max-sources\" min=\"1\" placeholder=\"20\">\n<h3>\ud83c\udfa8 T\u00e9ma</h3>\n<div id=\"theme-toggle\">\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"dark\"> S\u00f6t\u00e9t t\u00e9ma \ud83c\udf19</label>\n<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"light\" checked> Vil\u00e1gos t\u00e9ma \u2600\ufe0f</label>\n</div>\n<button id=\"save-settings\">Be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok ment\u00e9se</button>\n<button id=\"clear-cache\">\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f Cache t\u00f6rl\u00e9se</button>\n</section>\n</main>\n<nav>\n<ul>\n<li>Kezd\u0151lap</li>\n<li>Kutat\u00e1sok</li>\n<li>Jelent\u00e9sek</li>\n<li>Be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</body>\n</html>\n```","created_at":"2025-10-26T14:06:59.332866Z","label":null,"query_status":"COMPLETED","engine_mode":"reasoning"}]}
